{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38944","headline":"送僧归国清寺 · 杜荀鹤","name":"送僧归国清寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟送越僧归海涯，僧行浑不觉程赊。\n路沿山脚潮痕出，睡倚松根日色斜。\n撼锡度冈猿抱树，挈瓶盛浪鹭翘沙。\n到参禅後知无事，看引秋泉灌藕花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}